<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">Ibraawe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibraawe Asayis Xaafintteez Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ibraawe</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ibr.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ibraawe Asayis Xaafintteez Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Yha kiitay xaafintteezay, deexo meto hellin, fa ammana ashshodayis helleez ammaniza asayisii. Ye maxafitto xaafeezay, Yesuus Kiristtoosa wurssithinnee tuma Xooss qonccith maaqqeezana Ibraawe asayis beeziza. Ye ammaniza asay fa ammanayid miinggoday garkk unttan minthathiza. E yeya udittar hayidzii tumita aathii beeziza.</para>
  <para style="ili">1. Yesuusa fa ekkeez metayid fa Adayis tuma kiitintteez medhina Xooss Na7a. E Xooss Na7a maaqqeez gishos cima Caaqo wode yez nabitayppe, kiitanchchitayppennee Museppe lo7ithii aadhiza.</para>
  <para style="ili">2. Yesuusa cima Caaqo qeesitaypp ubbar aadhiz medhina qeese maaqqeezana Xoossii fa ommas markkatteeza.</para>
  <para style="ili">3. Yesuusa baggar ammaniza as nagarappe, yashshapenne yhayiqoppe attiza. Yesuusa qeese halaqa maaqqeeza, tiina Ibraawitay ammano wogannee mehe yarshshor eesho garkk benttiz atotitha yhatti tuma ootheeza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Xaafay Isreele asay taarikennee waarer yez asay ammano aaziso udii ekkii (Shem 11) yha maxafitto nabbabiza asitay fa ammanayid miinggoday garkk akaakisiza. Yey garkkekka, shemppo 12 nabbabizitay fa aafa Yesuusal afa gaddii, fa ammanayid miinggoday garkkennee aba metonnee waaye hellikokka, unttii garzhoday garkk zoriza. Wurssitha zorayidannee akaakiso qaalayid fa kiita aathiza.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ibraawe kiitay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo: Xoossii Kiristtoosar qoncceeza <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa kiitanchchitaypp afa <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 1:4-2:18">1:4—2:18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa Museppennee Iyyaasopp aath <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 3:1-4:13">3:1—4:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa qeesetithay ubbaypp aathii <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 4:14-7:28">4:14—7:28</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa qaala caaqay ubbapp aath <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 8:1-9:22">8:1—9:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa yarshshinttay puca <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 9:23-10:39">9:23—10:39</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammano bayratitha <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 11:1-12:29">11:1—12:29</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xooss ufaysso <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:1-19">13:1-19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wursith woosa <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:20-22">13:20-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Anjjonnee kustte <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:22-25">13:22-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Na7ay kiitanchchitaypp aathii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Binii binkko Xoossii, nu aditayis nabitay baggar duma duma oger gaame wode odeeza. <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>Zini yha wurssith wode ubba baz eza laatiseez ma alamakka e baggar medhdheez fa Na7ay baggar nuus odeeza. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>Na7ay Xooss bonchcha pocithinnee hanayir muumer Xooss aazii kunth Xooss Xoossatith ekkii, fa mawute qaalayir yha alama miinthii aykkeeza. Asa u nagaraypp shaagishsheezaypp guye Ubbapp afa Xooss ushachch salo betteeza.<verse eid="HEB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>Ees inggintteez sunthay kiitanchchitay sunthaypp aath maaqqeezay garkk E unttapp lo7ithii aadhiz gishosii. <verse eid="HEB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/>Yikkee, Xooss kiitanchchitaypp ooko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">«Neenii ta Na7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">ta yhayino nees ade maaqqeeza» yeegeenee?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">woy ooko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">«Taanii ees ade maaqqoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">eekka taas na7a maaqqoda» yeegeenee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz. 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Sam. 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1 Zeena. 17:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>Ma Xoossii fa bayra Na7a yha alame kiittittar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">«Xoossii kiitanchchitay ubbay ees goynno»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:6">yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Nam7i. 32:43</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>Xoossii kiitanchchitay bagga odittar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">«Xoossii fa Kiitanchchita carkkita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">fa ayllita tama lath udiza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:7">yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">Maz. 104:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>Zini fa Na7ay bagga odittar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">«Xoosso, ne kaatetithay medhinas yeziza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">Ne kaatetitha ne xillotithar aqisoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8-9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 45:6-7">Maz. 45:6-7</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>Neenii xillotithi doseeza; iitatith ixxeeza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">Xoossay, ne Goday, nena ne zhamitaypp aathii dooreeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">ufayss zayite<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ufayss zayite: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">E kawutiza wode asay ufayisar ililii eza kawutisiza beeziza.</char></note> nena tizheeza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:9">yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 61:1">Maz. 61:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 61:3">3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>Xoossii mahii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">«Godayyo, tiina neenii sa7a medhdheeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">salitay ne kushe oosita.<verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>Yeyititay ubbay dhaboda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">zin neenii yezoda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">Unttii ubbay afila garkk wuroda.<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>Neenii unttan saline garkk xaaxoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">ma unttii afila garkk laaminttoda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Zini neenii ubba wode nena;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">ne laythitayiskka wuristhii baaya»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:12">yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 102:25-27">Maz. 102:25-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>Zini Xooss kiitanchchitaypp ooko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">«Taanii ne morkkita ne tokay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">yedhdhiz aqo udod hellodayis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">yhaydda taapp ushachch baggar bettoba» yeegeenee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Kiitanchchitay ubbay atotith denggodayis yez asita maaddodayis Xoossii kiitteez ayyanita baasannee?<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Damma atotith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Yeyi gishos, nuunii si7eez tumaypp hara baz nuna ekkaamay garkk ye nu si7eezana miinthii naagodayis beeziza. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2"/>Yikkee, kiitanchchitay baggar odintteez qaalay tuma maaqqiko, eza leqqonnee kiitinttaam ixxay pirdda ki7izabaz maaqqiko, <verse eid="HEB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3"/>yeezin, nuunii yhay garkk gita atotitha ixxiko, wayizii buuttii attodee? Tiina Goday fa ommas ye atotitha odeeza; ma eepp si7eezitay nuus geeshshii markkatteeza. <verse eid="HEB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4"/>Ma Xooss mallitayir, oorothibazitayir, duma duma mala bazitayidannee fa shene garkk inggeez Geeshsha Ayyana imotithitayir markkatitha miintheeza.<verse eid="HEB 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa as atotithis kustte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Xoossii yha nuunii odiza tiinapp ye7od alama, kiitanchchitayis moodisekkaya. <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay pettii aqo yhay garkk yeegiza:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">«Neenii asis qoppodayis asii na7a aba bazo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">woy neenii eza naagodayis as na7a aba bazo?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:4-6">Maz. 8:4-6</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>Ne eza kiitanchchitaypp xiqqar laapitheeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">E ommayil bonchchonnee galata zawude gaddeeza.<verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>Ma ubba baz e toke oommo gaddeeza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">yeegiza. Xoossii ubba baz ees moodiseez wode ees moodintteekka abikka baaya. Zini yhatti ubba baz ees haarinttodar nuunii haga be7ekkaya. <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>Zini nuunii kiitanchchitaypp xiqqar laafeeza Yesuusa Xooss aadho keehatithaypp denddeezayid Yesuusa as ubbayis yhayqqeeza. E waaye yhayiqo yhayqqeez gishos bonchchonnee galata zawude e ommayil gaddin be7ada. <verse eid="HEB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>Ubba baz eeppennee eesi medhintteezay, gaame na7ita faar bonchchoko ko7odayis unttis atotith kusttennee waayer folo maaqqaday garkk oothodayis ees beeziza.<verse eid="HEB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Yesuusannee yha E geeshsheez asay ubbay pettii aday na7ita. Yesuusa unttan, «Ta ishuntho» gi xeegodayis yeellatekkazay yeyisii. <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/>Yesuusa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">«Taanii ne suntha ta ishitayis awajjoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">woya gancce nena yethar galatoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:12">yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">Maz. 22:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>Ma E, «Taanii ezal afa ammanttoda» yeegiza. Maakka, «Taannee Xoossii taas inggeez na7itayir ta yhaydda yeza» yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:17-18">Isa. 8:17-18</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Yikkee na7itay ashonnee suuthii yezita maaqqeez gishos Yesuusakka u garkk as maaqqeeza. E yeya udeezay, yhayiqol afa wolqqa yez Xalahe fa yhayiqayir shaarodayisii. <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>Ma fa yeza layth ubbayid yhayiqos yashshar ayllitii yezita aylletithapp wozodayisii.<verse eid="HEB 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/>Yesuusa ye7eezay Afraame zerethi maaddodayisapp attin kiitanchchita maaddodayis baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:8-9">Isa. 41:8-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>As nagaras yarshshinttodayis Xooss tiina maarizannee ammanintteez qeese halaqa maaqqeeza. Yeyi gishos, E ubba bazar fa ishita aazodayis beeziza. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>E fa ommas paacintti waaye ekkeez gishos paacinttizita maaddodayis danda7iza.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Musepp aadhiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Yeyi gishos, Xooss xeessa shagintteez geeshsha ishuntho, nu ammanos Goda gi xeegiz hawaarennee qeese halaqa Yesuusa bo7oytta. <verse eid="HEB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/>Muse Xooss Kara ubbayid ammanintteezay garkk Yesuusakka fana shuumeez Xoossayis ammanintteezaya. <verse eid="HEB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>Keeth keexxizay keethaypp aadhii bonchchinttizay garkk Yesuusa Musepp aadhiz bonchcho ekkodayis beeziza. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>Pettii pettii keethis keexxeez asii yeza, zin ubba haniseezay Xoosse. <verse eid="HEB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/>Muse Xoossii Kara ubbayid ammanintteez aylle maaqqii, Xoossii tiinapp godibazayis markka maaqqeeza. <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/>Zini Kiristtoosa Xoossis na7a garkk ammanintteezaya. Nuunii ekkoda gi yashsha bayth ceeqqor naagiza ufayisa miinthii naagiko nu E kara.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooss woyas yez shemppo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>Yeyi gishos, Geeshsha Ayyanay gizay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">«Yhayino yi Xoossay giza si7iko<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>liizho biitta yi tana paaceez gallas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">yi aditay worzhateezay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">yi wozina minthippate.<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>Ezayid yi aditay tana paacceeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">oyttam laythi ta oosa be7eeza.<verse eid="HEB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>Yeyi gishos, ta ye yeletitha seereeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">‹Unttii ubba wode fa wozinayir balinttiza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">ta oga erekkaya› ta yeegeeza.<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>Yeyi gishos,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">‹Ta shemppo aqa ubbarakka gelaamii› yeegii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">taanii ta seerayid caaqqeeza, yeegeeza» yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Maz. 95:7-11</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Ta ishuntho, yinttipp o ganccekka, de7o Xoossaypp yinttan shaakkiza iitannee ammanoowa wozina yezaamay garkk naaginttoytta. <verse eid="HEB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Yinttipp oonakka nagara balithin, fa wozina minthaamay garkk «Yhayino» yeeginttii xeeginttodar gallas gallas wolir zorinttoytta. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Nu tiina ammana nuunii wurssithii hellodayis miinthii naagiko, Kiristtoosar pettipp laattoda. <verse eid="HEB 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>Geeshsha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">«Yhayino Xoossii giza yi si7iz wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">ye wode unttii worzhetithar haneezay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">yi wozina miinthipate»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 3:15">yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Maz. 95:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>Xooss gizibaz si7ii worzheteezitay oonanttara? Muse Gibxxepp kaalithii kesseez ubbita baasannee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:1-35">Tay. 14:1-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Xoossii oyttam laythi oona seereenee? Nagara ootheezitannee u ahay liizho biitta wodhdhii atteez asita baasannee? <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Ma Xoossii, «Ta shemppo aqa u gelaamii» yeegii caaqeezay, ees kiitinttaam ixxeez asaysapp attin ooso? <verse eid="HEB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>Yikkee, unttii ye shemppo aqa gelekka atteezay ammanekka gishos maaqqeezana nu bo7oda.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Yikkee, Xoossii nuna fa shemppo aqo gelssoda geez qaalay haga tiinapp yez gishos yinttipp oonkka ye shemppo aqa gelekka attamay garkk wolla naaginttoda. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Unttis Wonggilay sabbakintteezay garkk, nuuskka sabbakintteeza. Zini unttii si7eezibaz ammanor ekkekka gishos unttan maaddekkaya. <verse eid="HEB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/>Hano zin, alame medhintteezaypp aykkii Xoossa oosay polintteez maaqqikokka, Xoossii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">«Taanii ta kachchayid caaqqeeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">ta shemppo aqo ubbarakka u gelaamii»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">geezay garkk, nuunii ammaneezitay e shemppo aqo geloda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Maz. 95:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/>Laappuntha gallasibagga pettii aqo, «Xooss laappuntha gallasa fa ooso ubbaypp shemppeeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Medhe. 2:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/>Maakka ye aqayid, «Unttii ta shemppo aqa ubbarakka gelaamii» yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Maz. 95:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Tiina Wonggile si7eezitay kiitinttaam ixxii shemppo aqa gelekkaya. Yeya maaqqikokka, yhattekka ye shemppo aqa gelo ginttintteez pettii pettii asitay yeza. <verse eid="HEB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/>Yeyi gishos, Xoossii, «Yhayino» gi xeegodar pettii gallase nuus qamma gaddeeza. Gaame wodepp guye Xoossii Dawute baggar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">«Xoossii gizibaz yhayino yi si7iz wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">yi wozina minthippate»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:7">yeegii odeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Maz. 95:7-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>Iyyaaso unttis shemppo inggeezibaz maaqqeezako, Xoossii hara gallasibagga guyeppe odaamizin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:7">Nam7i. 31:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:4">Iyya. 22:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Yikkee, Xooss asayis maala gallas shemppo garkk shemppay naaginttii yeza. <verse eid="HEB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/>Xooss shemppo aqa geliza oonkka, Xoossii fa oosaypp shemppeezay garkk eekka fa oosaypp shemppoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Medhe. 2:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Yeyi gishos, oonkka ye asay kiitintto ixxa kaallii, pokkaamay garkk wolla Xooss shemppo aqa gelodayis minggoda.<verse eid="HEB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Xooss qaalay pathi yezannee oothizaya. Nam77ii baggar leefintteez mashshapp aadhii oco. E shemppo, ayyana, xaphonnee koli7ize hellodayis sattissii caddiza. Ma as wozina yez qosintteez qofannee amo shaakkii pirddiza. <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Xooss tiinapp qosintteez aba medhetithikka baaya. E aafe tiina ubba baz qonccennee kallo yeza. Nuunii mahith inggodayis beezizay e tiinaydda.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa ubbaypp aadho qeese halaqa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Yikkee, salitayil afa kezeezi ubbaypp aath qeese halaqay, Xooss na7a Yesuusa, nuus yeza gishos nu ammana miinthii naagoda. <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>Nu qeese halaqay nu daaburodar nuus qadhinttodayis danda7izaya. E nagara oothekka, zin nu garkk ubba bazar paacintteeza. <verse eid="HEB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Yikkee, maarotith ekkodayisinnee maadee koshshiza wode aadho keehatithaypp denggodayis aadho keehatithay yeza aqo Xooss zufaanayiko yashitekka shiiqoda.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Pettii pettii qeesitay halaqa asay ganccepp maraxinttii, Xoossar helthiza baza asay gishos imotarannee nagara yarshsho yarshshodayis shuuminttiza. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>E fa ommas daabura maaqqeez gishos erozitayisinnee balinttizitayis qadhinttodayis danda7iza. <verse eid="HEB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/>E fa nagara gishonnee as ubba nagara gishos yarshsho yarshshodayis beezizay yeyisii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Lewii. 9:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/>Oonkka yha bonchcha paas ekkodayis danda7oowa, zin Aaroona qeesitay halaqa maaqqodayis xeegintteezay garkk Xoossar xeeginttodayis beeziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Kes. 28:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/>Yey garkkekka, Kiristtoosa qeesitay halaqa maaqqith bonchcha taas beeziza gi fa ommas ekkekkaya. Zini Xoossii eza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">«Neenii ta Na7a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">Yhayino nena ta yeleeza» eeko</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 5:5">yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz. 2:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>Ma hara aqo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">«Malkkexaadiqe qeese maaqqeezay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">neenii medhinas qeese maaqqoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 5:6">yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maz. 110:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>Yesuusa as maaqqii yha alamel yez wode fana yhayiqoppe ashshodayis danda7iza Xoossa gaame yeeforannee aafuthar woosseeza. E, eza bonchchii kiitintteez gishos Xoossii e woosa si7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat. 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar. 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luq. 22:39-46</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Yesuusa Xooss Na7a maaqqikokka fa waayintteez waayayid kiitintta tamaareeza. <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>Yeyidakka, Yesuusa folo maaqqeezaypp guye paas kiitinttiza ubbay medhina atotitha denggoday garkk oge maaqqeeza. <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>Xoossii Malkkexaadiqe qeesetithis shuumeezay garkk qeesitay halaqa udii eza shuumeeza.<verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanor diccoday garkk inggintteez naagiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>Ya nu odayil afa gujjii nashshod gaame baz yeza, zin yi akaakay xiqqa maaqqeez gishos yinttis odii gelssoday waayithiza. <verse eid="HEB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/>Yi yhannontte asitamaare maaqqodayis beeziza, zin Xooss qaala tiina timirtta yinttan mahii taamarssiza hara as koshshiza. Yi mino katha maadayis danda7oozay gishos maathi koshshiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:2">1 Qor. 3:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/>Maathi pakinttiza oonkka duude na7a maaqqeez gishos lo77onnee iita shaakkii erooya. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Zini mino katha lo77onnee iita shaakkii eror looheez asayisii.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1"/>Yikkee, Kiristtoosa bagga taamarssiza tiina timirtta ashii Kiristtoosar foloko yhammada. Yhayqqeez oosopp maarotith gelonnee Xooss ammano bagga tiina timirttayiko guye maaqqii mahii baasaamii. <verse eid="HEB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2"/>Yeyititaykka, xinqqatitay bagga,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Xinqqatitayi bagga: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ya aqo xinqqatitayi bagga giinttintteezay duma duma geeshsho wogitayibagga ododadayis.</char></note> kushe gaddo bagga, yhayiqopp dendo baggannee medhina pirdda bagga mahii tamaaraam. <verse eid="HEB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Xoossii giiko nu yeya udoda.<verse eid="HEB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4"/>Pettii toke poo7o unttis poo7eezita, salo imota ekkeezita, Geeshsha Ayyanar shaakintteezita, <verse eid="HEB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5"/>lo77o Xooss qaalannee tiinapp ye7od alamay wolqqa be7eezita, <verse eid="HEB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6"/>guyeppe kaddeezita nagaraypp nam7intho mahodayis danda7inttooya. Abis giiko, unttii fa dhabos Xooss Na7a mahii sotizay garkk mazqalel afa eza sotteeza woya tiina kawushshiza.<verse eid="HEB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>Ubba wode Iil afa bukkiza ira uzhii, wooteez atha maaddiza kathi inggiza biittay Xooss anjjeezanno. <verse eid="HEB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/>Zini anggunthinnee gijje doliz biittat abikka adamii; iis qanggithii ukkeeza; wurssithal iza xuuginttoda.<verse eid="HEB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Nu siiqo ishuntho, nuunii yhay garkk odiza baz maaqqikokka, yinttan atotithiko kaalithiza lo77o baz yinttis yezana eriza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-18">Medhe. 3:17-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>Xooss luule pirddiza. Xoossii, yi ootheez oosonnee tiina maaqqin yhattekka ammanizita maaddii, ees yez siiqo beezeezana dogooya. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>Yi ubbay ufayisar naagizana denggod hellodayis yha minotitha wurssithii hellodayis beezoday garkk nu amottiza. <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>Yi ammanorannee danda7ar naagiza ufayssa laattiza asa aazoday garkkeppe attin azaalla maaqqodana nu koyooya.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooss inggeez ufayssay sidhisooya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Xooss Afraames ufayis qaala inggod gi caaqqodar fappe aadhiz hara gita baa gishos fa ommas caaqqeeza. <verse eid="HEB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/>Eeko, «Taanii nena anjjoda; ne zerithakka gaanthoda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-17">Medhe. 22:16-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Afraame danda7ar naageez Xoossay inggod geez ufayssa ekkeeza.<verse eid="HEB 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Asii caaqqittar fapp dammiza athayir caaqqiza; u fa oda caaqor miinthii, woli gancce yez palama ubba teqqiza. <verse eid="HEB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Yeyi gishos, Xooss fa laaminttoowa qofa ufayis qaala laattizitayis qonccisodayis koyeez gishos caaqor unttis miintheeza. <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>Xooss laaminttoowazitannee wordotoowa nam7i bazita guussay ufayssinnee caaqqa nuus inggeeza. Yha nam7i bazitaypp dendeezayid nu tiinayid yez ufayisa miinth aykkodayis danda7odayis zemppo denggodayis eeko qosintteez nuunii wolqqama minthatho denggoda.<verse eid="HEB 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/>Ya ufayssay nu shemppos, markkabe eni7aamay garkk miinthii aykkiz wodoro garkke. Ye ufayssay magarazhapp guye bagga yez geesh aqa geliza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2">Lewii. 16:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/>Yesuusa Malkkexaadiqe shuumatethay garkk medhinas qeesitay halaqa maaqqii, nu gishos nuupp tiinattii ye aqa geleeza.<verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Qeese Malkkexaadiqe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>Malkkexaadiqqee, Saleeme Kaatay, Ubbapp aath Xooss qeese. Ye Malkkexaadiqe Afraame kaatitana olii gamii maaqqodar eza hellii anjjeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:17-20">Medhe. 14:17-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/>Afraame fa yeza baz ubbaypp ees asiraata kessii inggeeza. Malkkexaadiqe sunthay tiina «Xillotith kaat», nam7intho, «Saleeme kaat» bili7ithay, «Sarotith kaat» guussii. <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>Malkkexaadiqes indii woy ade woy zare taybo baaya. E yeletithayis dendo woy e de7ayis wurssithii baaya, zin Xooss Na7a aazii medhinas qeese maaqqeeza.<verse eid="HEB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>Malkkexaadiqe ab garkk dammazako bo7oytta. Nu aditayis mayizay, Afraame, fa yeza baazaypp ees asiraata inggeeza. <verse eid="HEB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/>Qeese maaqqeez Lewe zaray Isreele asaypp, yeykka Afraame zerethi maaqqeez fa ishitaypp asiraata ekkoday garkk higge kiittiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Tay. 18:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/>Malkkexaadiqe Lewe zare maaqqaam ixxikokka Afraamepp asiraata ekkeeza; ufayis qaala yez Afraamena anjjeeza. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Xiqqay damayir anjjinttizay palamthooya.<verse eid="HEB 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Pettii baggar, asiraata ekkizitay yhayqqiz asita, zin hara baggar asiraata ekkizay yhayqqekka yeza yeegii odintteez melkkexaadiqe. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9"/>Yikkee, asiraata ekkiz Lewe, Afraame baggar asiraata inggeez godayis danda7inttiza. <verse eid="HEB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10"/>Abis giiko, Malkkexaadiqe Afraamer woli hellodar Lewe haga yelinttekka maaqqikokka, fa mayiza Afraame gulbatayid yeza.<verse eid="HEB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>Isreele asayis higge Lewe qeesetithay baggar inggitteeza. Ye Lewe qeesetithay folo maaqqeez baz maaqqeezako Aaroonasay garkk baazin, Malkkexaadqe garkk hara qeese shuumodayis koshshaamizin. <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>Yikkee, qeesitay laaminttodar higgaykka ma laaminttodayis beeziza. <verse eid="HEB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Yeya nu ebaz odiza athay hara zare; e sheeshaypp oonkka yarshsho aqo qeesetith oothekkaya. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>Nu Goday Yihuda sheeshaypp ye7eezay erintteezaya. Hano zin, Muse qeesitay bagga odittar Yihuda kochch bagga abikka odekkaya.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>Malkkexaadiqe garkk hara qeese ye7eezibaz maaqqeezako yha nu odizabazay aadhii qonccoda. <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>E qeese maaqqeezay dhaboowa de7o wolqqayirapp attin e mayza higgerannee wogayir baaya. <verse eid="HEB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">«Malkkexaadiqe qeesetithay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:17">neenii medhinas qeese»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 7:17">yeegii markkattiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maz. 110:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Tiina higgay daaburannee maaddaama maaqqeez gishos shaarintteeza. <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>Muse higgay abarakka folo maaqqodayis danda7ekkaya. Zini nuunii yhatti Xoossiko shiiqodayis ubbaypp aadhiz ufayis qaalay nuus inggintteeza.<verse eid="HEB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Kiristtoosa qeese maaqqeez wode Xoossii caaqqeeza, zin yhankkitay qeese maaqqeez wode yeya garkk caaqay baaya. <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/>Zini Yesuusa qeese maaqqeezay Xooss caaqqora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">«Goday eeko ‹Neenii medhina qeese› yeegii caaqqeeza; E fa qofa laammooya»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 7:21">yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maz. 110:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>Ya caaqaypp denddeezayid Yesuusa nuus ubbaypp aadhiz qaala caaqayis waase maaqqeeza.<verse eid="HEB 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>Tiina qeesitay taybay gaame zin qeesetith oothaamay garkk yhayiqo unttan kayeeza. <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>Zini Yesuusa medhinas yeziza gishos e qeesetithay laaminttooya. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Yeyi gishos, E ubba wode u gishos guurodayis medhinas yez gishos Xoossiko e baggar yi7izita folo ashshodayis danda7iza.<verse eid="HEB 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>Yikkee, nuus beeziza baz inggiza, geeshshay, boronnee tuna baazay, nagaranchchitayppe shaakintteezayinnee salopp aadhii dhoqqeez qeese halaqay nuus koshshiza. <verse eid="HEB 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/>E yhankko qeese halaqitay garkk tiina fa nagara gishos kaallii as nagara gishos gallas gallas yarshsho yarshshodayis koshshooya. E fana yarshsheez wode yhaya lammamayis pettii toke wursii ashsheeza<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Lewii. 9:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Muse higgay daabura asa qeese halaqa udii shuumiza. Zini higgaypp guye ye7eez caaqo qaalay medhinas folo maaqqeez Xooss Na7ana shuumeeza.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa orothi caaqo qeesitay halaqa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>Nuunii odeez baazaypp waannay yheya. Salo Ubbapp Afa Xooss zufaanaypp ushachch bagga betteez yhay garkk qeese halaqay nuus yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>E oothizay tuma dunkkaane maaqqeez geeshsha aqo, ye dunkkanat tukintteezana as kusher baazin Goday kushera.<verse eid="HEB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>Qeese halaqa ubbay muxaatasinnee yarshsho yarshshodayis shuuminttiza. Yeyi gishos, yha qeesay yarshshodayis pettibazii yezodayis koshshiza. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>Higge kiitizay garkk yarshshiza qeesitay yez gishos Kiristtoosa sa7a yeza baz maaqqeezako qeese baaya. <verse eid="HEB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/>Unttii qeesetith oothiza dunkkaanay salo yezayis aazisonnee eesho. Muse dunkkaana essiza wode Xooss eeko, «Taanii nena derell afa beezeez aazisa kaallii naaginttor oothoba» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Kes. 25:40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/>Yhatti maaqqiko Yesuusa gancce gelii dabbothiza qaala caaqay, tiina qaala caaqaypp aadhizay gishos E ekkeez oosay unttiisaypp aadhiza. Yeyi eqqeezay aadhiz ufayis qaalayida.<verse eid="HEB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Tiina qaala caaqayid boro baa maaqqeezako nam7inth qaala caaqo koshshooya. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/>Zini Goday eza borii, yhaygarkk yeegeeza:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">«Taanii Isreele asayirannee Yihuda asayira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">oroth qaala caaqo caaqqiza wode ye7oda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Erim. 31:31-34</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>Ye qaala caaqay ta u aditay Gibxxe biittapp kushe aykkii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">goochchii kesseez wode unttar caaqqeez caaqay garkk baaya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Goday unttii ta caaqayid ammaninttekkazay gishos</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">taanii unttan olii ashsheeza yeegiza.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>Zini yikkepp guye Isreele asayira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">ta caaqqod caaqay yhaya yeegiza Goday.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Taanii ta higga u kahayid gaddoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">u wozinayidakka xaafoda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Taanii u Xoossa maaqqoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">unttikka ta woya maaqqoda.<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>Unttapp oonkka fa shoora woy fa isha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">‹Goda eroba› yeegii tamaarssamii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Unttii xiqqapp damma hellodayis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">ubbay tana eroda.<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>Taanii u naaqa atto goda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">u qoha mahii qoppaamii»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 8:12">yeegiza.<verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>Xoossii yha caaqa «Orothi qaala caaqo» guussay tiinaasa cima maheeza. Yikkee, cimayinnee ceegay dhabiza wode helleeza.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Cima caaqo wode goynno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Tiina caaqayis Xooss goynno wogayinnee sa7a dunkkaanay yeza. <verse eid="HEB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/>Tiina dunkkaanay giigeeza. Ezayid xomppe gaddiz kochchii, xarpheezannee yarshsho boora yeza; ye aqay geeshshii ginttittiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:1-30">Kes. 26:1-30</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">25:31-40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/>Nam7antho magarazhaypp guye baggar yez aqay ubbaypp aadho geeshsha aqo ginttinttiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Kes. 26:31-33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/>E gancce ixaannee cuyishiz worqqa qendelennee worqqar goolintteez qaala caaqo Taabotay yeza. Ye caaqo Taabotayid manna yez worqqa xaaro, aaceez Aaroona gufayinnee Muse higge xaafintteez nam77ii lochche shuchchitay yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-6">Kes. 30:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:10-16">25:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 16:33">16:33</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 17:8-10">Tay. 17:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:16">Kes. 25:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:3-5">Nam7i. 10:3-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/>Ye Taabotayil afa baggar atotith kame fa qefayid kammiza bonchcho kirubeelitay yeza. Zini yhatt ye ubba qonccisii ododayis danda7ooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:18-22">Kes. 25:18-22</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>Ya ubbay yhay garkk giigeezaypp guye, qeesitay ubba wode fa oosa oothodayis dunkkaanayis tiina bagga kifila geliza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:2-6">Tay. 18:2-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/>Zini qeese halaqay aadda dunkkaanayis nam7intho kifile laythapp pettii toke geliza. E ya gelittar fa nagara gishonnee asay erekka ootheez nagara gishos suuth yarshsho ekkekka gelooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2-34">Lewii. 16:2-34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>Tiina dunkkaanay eqqii yezin, Ubbapp geeshsha aqo kanggiza oge haga dooyinttekkaza Geeshsha Ayyanay yeya erisiza.<verse eid="HEB 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Yeyi yha wodayis aaziso; Xoossis ingginttiza imannee yarshshay goynniza athay kaha geeshshodayis danda7oozana yhay beeziza. <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>Yeyititay muuss bagga, ushsh bagga duma duma meechch wogitay bagga odizita. Unttii oroxxiza wode ye7od hellodayis oosinttiza baale wogita bagga.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>Zin Kiristtoosa yhatti nu denggeez lo77o bazitayis qeesitay halaqa maaqqii ye7eeza. E geleez dunkkaanay dammannee folo maaqqeeza. Ye dunkkaanay as kusher oosinttekkazannee yha alamaypp medhintteezanno. <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>Kiristtoosa Ubbapp Geesh aqo gelitar deesh suuthinnee ooggona suuth ekkii gelekkaya. Zini medhina atotitha inggodayis fa suuth ekkii lamamayis pettii toke geleeza. <verse eid="HEB 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/>Deesh suuthinnee wofaano suuth, xuugintteez uss budo, tuneez asayil afa dharccinttii unttan geeshshizabaz maaqqiko,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:15-16">Lewii. 16:15-16</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 19:9">Tay. 19:9</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 19:17-19">17-19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>medhina Ayyana baggar boro baa yarshsho udii, Xoossayis fana inggeez Kiristtoosa suuth, yeza de7o Xooss goynnoday garkk yhayiqo kaalithiza oosaypp nu kaha wayizii aathii geeshshoosa?<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>Yeyi gishos, xeegintteezitay Xoossii inggeez medhina laata ekkoday garkk Kiristtoosa oroth caaqayis gancce gelii dabbothiza maaqqeeza. Yeyi haneezay asay tiina caaqaypp oommo yez wode ootheez nagaraypp unttan wozodayis E yhayqqayida.<verse eid="HEB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Yikkee, keeke yeeziko, ye keekeez athay yhayqqithay erinttodayis koshshiza. <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>Keekeez athay yhayqqiko e keekay miinggiza. Keekeez athay yhayqqekka attiko e keekay oothooya.<verse eid="HEB 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Hara attozin, tiina caaqaykka suuthii bayth minggekka. <verse eid="HEB 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/>Muse higge azazita ubba asayis odeezaypp guye ooggona suuthinnee deesh suuthii haathar walakkii, zoqo dur ikisennee hisophe ekkii, maxafayil afannee asayil afa wurxxeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Kes. 24:6-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>Muse asayiko, «Yi naagoday garkk Xoossii kiitteez suuth caaqay yhaya» yeegeeza. <verse eid="HEB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/>Yey garkkekka, dunkkaanayidannee oothiza miishe ubbayil afa suuth wurxxeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:15">Lewii. 8:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/>Tumakka higgay gizay garkk xiqqabazitaypp attin ubba baz suuthar geezhiza. Suuthii laalinttekkazin nagara baranchchinttooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:11">Lewii. 17:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>Salobaz aaziso maaqqeezitay ubbay mehe yarshshor geezhodayis koshshiza. Zin salobazitay fa ommas yeypp aadhiz yarshshor geezhodayis koshshiza.<verse eid="HEB 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Kiristtoosa tuma Xooss keethayis aaziso maaqqeeza, as kusher oosintteez Ubbapp Geeshsha aqo gelekkaya. Zin E yhatti nu gishos Xooss tiina benttodayis salo geleeza. <verse eid="HEB 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>Qeese halaqay laytha laytha fa suuthii baaza ekkii, Ubbaypp aadhiz Geesh aqo gelizay garkk Kiristtoosa gaame toke fana yarshshodayis maaqqii maaqqii gelekkaya. <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>Yey garkk haneezibaz maaqqeezako, Kiristtoosa alame medhintteezaypp aykkii gaame toke waayinttodayis koshshiza. Zini yhatte wode wurssitha nagara dhabisodayis fana yarshsheez lamisowa oger pettii toke bentteeza.<verse eid="HEB 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>As ubbayis pettii toke yhayqqodayis yeypp guye pirddinttodayis beeziza. <verse eid="HEB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/>Yey garkkekka, Kiristtoosa gaame asay nagara dhabisodayis pettii toke yarshshintteeza. Maaqqikka E nagara tookodayis baazin fana naagizita ashshodayis nam7intho qonccoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa. 53:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>Muse higgay ye7odayis yez lo77o bazitayis eeshopp attin gamma baaya. Yeyi gishos, laytha laytha pace bayth yarshshinttiz yarshshay goynnodayis shiiqiza asay folo oothoayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Higge unttan folo oothoayis danda7eezako unttii yarshsho yarshshiza ashshodazin. Ma goynnodayis shiiqiza asay fa nagaraypp geezhoda; u kahaykka unttan bala gi mootaamii. <verse eid="HEB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>Zini ye yarshshitay laytha laytha nagara qofisiza. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Abis giiko, wofaano suuthinnee deesh suuthii nagara kayodayis danda7ooya.<verse eid="HEB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/>Yeyi gishos, Kiristtoosa yha alame ye7eez wode yhay garkk yeegeeza:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">«Neenii yarshshonnee imo koyekkaya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">zin taas asho giigiseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">Maz. 40:6-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>Neenii xuuginttiz yarshshayidannee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">nagara yarshshayid ufayttekkaya.<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>Ye wode ‹Ta gishos maxaafayid xaafintteezay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">Godayyo, taanii ne shene oothodayis ye7eeza› yeegeeza.»<verse eid="HEB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>Yarshsho yarshshinttoday garkk higge kiittizabaz maaqqikokka, Kiristtoosa tiina, «Neenii yarshshonnee muxaata, xuuginttiz yarshshonnee nagara yarshsho koyekkaya; unttal ufayttekkaya» yeegeeza. <verse eid="HEB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>Kaallikka E, «Godayyo, yeezako taanii ne shene oothodayis ye7eeza» yeegeeza. Yeyi gishos, Kiristtoosa nam7antho essodayis tiinaasa shaareeza. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosa Xooss shene udii, lamamayis pettii toke fa asho yarshsheez gishos nuunii geezheeza.<verse eid="HEB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>Qeese ubbay, nagara dhabisodayis danda7oday ye yarshshita gallas gallas yarshshittar eqqii fa oosa oothiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:38">Kes. 29:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/>Zini Kiristtoosa medhinas maaqqeez pettii nagara yarshsho yarshsheez, Xoossaypp ushachch bagga betteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>Ye wodaypp ayikkii e morkkitay e tokayis yedhdhizibaz udod hellodayis naagiza. <verse eid="HEB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>E pettii toke fana yarshsheez yarshshayid geeshshita medhinas folo udeeza.<verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>Ma Geeshsha Ayyanay nuus yhay markkattiza. Tiina yhaygarkk yeegeeza:<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>«Ye gallasitaypp guye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">taanii unttar caaqqiza caaqay yhaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Taanii ta higga u kahayid gaddoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">u wozinayid xaafoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 10:16">yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:33">Erim. 31:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>Kaallikka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">«Taanii u nagarannee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:17">u iita oosa mahii qoppaamii»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 10:17">yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:34">Erim. 31:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>Yikkee, nagara atto ginttintteezaypp guye nagaras yarshshinttiza yarshshay koshshooya.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossiko shiiqoda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>Yikkee, ta ishuntho, nuunii Yesuusa suuth baggar Ubbapp Geeshsha aqo gelodayis nuus ammanthizabaz denggeeza. <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>Nu gelodana Kiristtoosa fa magarazha, yeykka fa asho baggar nuus dooyeez orothinnee de7o maaqqeez ogayra. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>Nuus Xooss Karal afa shuumintteez gita qeese yeza. <verse eid="HEB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/>Nuunii iita kahaypp geezhodayis nu wozina wurxinttii, nu asetitha xillo haathar meecinttii, luule wozinarannee folo ammanor Xoossiko shiiqoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:30">Lewii. 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:25">Iziqe. 36:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>Nuus ufayis qaala inggeez Xoossay ammanintteezay gishos nu markkattiz ufayssa ushachch haddirss geekka miinthii aykkoda. <verse eid="HEB 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>Pettay petta siiqorannee lo77o oosor nu wayizii barkk yezodayis beezizako qoppiso. <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>Pettay pettay kasee shiiqiza shiiqa ashshekazay garkk nuunii pettipp shiiq zorinttizana ashshaamii. Maaqqikka Goda gallasay ukkeezaya yi bi7iza gishos yeya kaseesaypp aathii oothoytta.<verse eid="HEB 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>Nuunii tuma eratith ekkeezaypp guye erittar nagara oothiko, yikkepp nu nagara gishos yarshshinttod yarshshay baaya. <verse eid="HEB 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/>Yikkee atteezay yashshiz pirddannee Xooss morkkita xuuggodayis maaqqeez wolqqama tama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:11">Isa. 26:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/>Muse higga kiitinttaam ixxeez oonkka nam77ii woy hayidzii as ezal afa markkatiko maarotith bayth yhayqqiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Nam7i. 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/>Yeezin, Xooss Na7a kadheez athay, fana geeshsheez Xooss qaala caaqo suutha tuna baz garkk qoppeez athay, ma aadho keehatith Ayyana cazheez athay, ab garkk iita pirdda ekkodayis beezizako ane qoppoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Kes. 24:6-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/>Yikkee, «Kushe keso tabaz, ta kushe kessoda» geeza nu eriza. Maakka, «Goday fa asay pirddoda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Nam7i. 32:35</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 32:36">36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>De7o Xooss kushe pokkithii iita yashshiza.<verse eid="HEB 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>Yinttis Xooss poo7o poo7eezaypp guye yi gaame waayer, gita buter garzheez binii wode qoppoytta. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>Pettii pettii toke yi as tiina cazhintteeza; bayi7intteeza; pettii pettii toke yeya garkk waaye helleez asayir pettipp waayeeza. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>Aadhoowannee ubba wode yeziz miishe yinttis salo yezana ereezaygishos achcha yez asayis ta qadhdheeza, yi shalay ekinttodarakka danda7ar yeya yi ufayisar ekkeeza. <verse eid="HEB 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>Gita woytto yeza gishos yi goobetitha olippate. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Xooss shene oothii yinttis inggintteez ufayis qaala yi demmad garkk yibbatii naagodayis koshshiza. <verse eid="HEB 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/>Haga xiqqa wode yeza, «ye7odayis yezay ye7oda gam7enna. <verse eid="HEB 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>Geeshsha asii ammanor yeziza, guye soli7iko ta shemppata ezal ufayttooya.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:3-4">Inba. 2:3-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>Nuna maaqqiko fa shemppo ashshodayis ammaniza asayir yezapp attin dhabos guye soli7iz asayir baaya.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Ammano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>Ammano guussay ufayis gaddii be7ekka baz be7eezay garkk udii beeziza bazi. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>Binii asay baz markatintteezay ammanora.<verse eid="HEB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>Alamay Xooss qaalar medhintteezana nu erizay ammanora, yey gishos benttiz baz ubbay benttowa bazapp haneezana nu eriza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:1">Medhe. 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:6">Maz. 33:6</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 33:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:3">Wan. 1:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/>Aabeela Qaa7eelasaypp aadhiz yarshsho shiisheezay ammanora. Xoossay Aabeela yarshsha ufayisar ekkin Aabeela fa ammanayir geeshsha maaqqeezay markatintteeza, E yhayqqeezibaz maaqqikokka e ammanay baggar yhattekka odittar yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-10">Medhe. 4:3-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>Inooke yhayiqo be7aamay garkk fude ekkintteezay ammanora, Xoossii eza ekkeez gishos benttekkaya, e ekinttodaypp tiina e Xooss ufaysseezay ees markatintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">Medhe. 5:21-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Ammano bayith Xoossa ufayssodayis danda7ooya, Xoossiko shiiqiza aathii Xooss yezananee Eza koyiz asayis imota inggiza maaqqeezana ammanodayis beeziza.<verse eid="HEB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>Nohe haga aafer benttowa bazitayis Xoossii eza naaginttoday garkk erseez woda Xoossis yashittittar fa kara asa ashshodayis ammanor markkabe kochcheeza, Nohe ammanayir alamay nagarancho maaqqeezay erinttin pirddintteeza, Nohe ammanor benttiz xillotith laateeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:13-22">Medhe. 6:13-22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/>Afraame ees odinteezana fa gade udii ekkodayis kezo gi xeegin ana yhanigizako erekkazar kezeezay ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-5">Medhe. 12:1-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/>Ezar wolla ufayssa qaala laattizita maaqqeezitay Isaaqarannee Yayqqoobar wola bettetith gade imathi maaqqii dunkkaane yezeezay ammanora<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:27">Medhe. 35:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>Baasor yezanno Xoossii medhdheezanonnee kochcheez katamtto ekkodayis naagttar yeza.<verse eid="HEB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/>Saaris ufayis inggeez Xoossay ammaninttiza maaqqeezana ereez gishos layithi wurkokka wodexodayis wolqqa denggeezay ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:11-14">Medhe. 18:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/>Yey gishos yhayqqeez as garkk tayibintteez pettii Afraamepp salo xoolintto garkkennee sa7a shafe garkk kochchii bentteeza.<verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>Yhayttitay ubbitay ammanor yezar yhayqqeeza, Xoossay unttis immadayis qaala geleezannokka denggekkaya, maaqqozin haakor bi7ii dengeezay garkk udii ufayssar ekkeeza. Biittal afa u immathinnee bette maaqqeezanakka ereeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:15">1 Zeena. 29:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:12">Maz. 39:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Yhay garkk yeegiz asay paas maaqqiz gade naagizana tiishii udii beeziza. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>U fa kezeez gada qoppeezako ged guye maaqqodayis danda7odazin. <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>Yhatti maaqqiko aadhiz salo yez gada laamotiza, yey gishoss Xoossii unttis katama giigiseez gishos nu Goda gi xeegodayis yeellathooya.<verse eid="HEB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/>Afraame paacintteez wode Isaaqana yarshshos shiisheezay ammanora. E ufayis qaala ekkeezay fa mixii na7a yarshshodayisii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Medhe. 22:1-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/>Yeezin Xoossii Isaaqa kochchar xeeginttiza geezin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Medhe. 21:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Xoossay yhayiqopp denthodayis danda7izana Afraame ammaneez gishoss yhayqqeez aaziz Afraame Isaaqa denggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Medhe. 21:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/>Isaaqa tiinapp hanod baz bi7ii Yayqqoobannee Eesawe anjeezay ammanora.<verse eid="HEB 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>Yayqqooba yhayqqos hellii gufer eqqii Yooseefa na7ita anjeezay ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:27-29">Medhe. 27:27-29</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 27:39-40">39-40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/>Yooseefakka yhayiqos hellii ammanor isireele na7itay kessii bagga qoppeeza. Fa meqqethay baggakka keekeeza. <verse eid="HEB 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/>Muse yelintteez wode kara asay yegelss na7a maaqqeezana bi7ii hayidz agina qoseezay ammanora. Kaatay awajjayisikka yashittekkaya.<verse eid="HEB 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/>Musekka diceezaypp guye Faaronas na7a na7a ginttodana ixxeezay ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:10-12">Kes. 2:10-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>Yey gishos ezii nagarara benttiz ufayssapp aathii Xooss woyar meto ekkodana dooreeza. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>Tiinasikka fa ekkod gata tishshi udii be7eez gishos Gibxxe shalopp Kiristtoosa gishos kawuzhizay aadho maaqqeezana qoppeeza. <verse eid="HEB 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>Kaatay kachchayis yashittekkazar Gibxxepp kezeezay ammanora, aafer be7ekka godakka be7eezay garkk udii fa qofayid miinggeeza. <verse eid="HEB 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/>Bayira na7ita wodhodayis kiitintteez kiitanchchitay Isreelitay kara gelaamay garkk paaziqa udeezayinnee shoonchchitta suuthii tizheezay ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:21-30">Kes. 12:21-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>Isreelitay mela biittar piinggoday garkk udin zoqo abba piinggeezay ammanora, Gibxxe asay unttiisay garkk qullii gelii mitintteeza. <verse eid="HEB 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>Isreelitay Iyarkko gase kaler laappun gallas wutteezaypp guye keethay wodeezay ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:12-21">Iyya. 6:12-21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/>Wushumiza Ra7aaba awuzhizita saror mokkeez gishos azazinttowa asayir yhayqqekka atteezay ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Iyya. 2:1-21</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 6:22-25">6:22-25</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>Yikk ta hara ab go Geedoona bagga, Baareqa bagga, Samsonnee bagga, Yofitahe bagga, Dawute bagga, Sam7eela bagga, nabitay bagga ta tossaamay garkk taas woday haateeza<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:11-8:32">1 Kaat. 6:11—8:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/>Unttii ammanor kaatetithita latheeza<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 4:6-5:31">Daani. 4:6—5:31</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:11-8:32">6:11—8:32</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:2-16:31">13:2—16:31</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:1-12:7">11:1—12:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:1-2:11">1 Sam. 16:1—1 Kaat. 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:1-25:1">1 Sam. 1:1—25:1</ref></char></note> xillo oosokka ootheeza, unttis inggintteez ufayis qaala denggeeza gaammitay donakka gorddeeza. <verse eid="HEB 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/>Tama wolqqa dhabiseeza, mashsha ocoppe buutteeza, daaburssapp minotitha laamintteeza, olar qarita maaqqeeza, allaga olanchita bayi7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:1-27">Daan. 6:1-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/>Maachitay yhayqqeez u dabbitay dendin be7eeza, baggitay atotith denggekkazar tiinapp dendodayis qopp duma duma meto ekkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:1-30">Daan. 3:1-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/>Yhankkitay kaas baz maaqqii shocintt yeypp aadho achchar duxxinttii woyine wodhdheeza. <verse eid="HEB 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/>Shuchchar shocinttii, magaazer qo7intteeza, mashshar gachchinttii yhayqqeeza, ubba baz dhabin metintteeza, manqqonne bette as garkk waayeeza, deesh maa7onnee dur maa7o ma77ii yuuyeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:26">1 Kaat. 22:26</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:25">2 Zeena. 18:25</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 18:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:2">Erim. 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:15">37:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:6">38:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>Liizho gadhara, amba xeerara, biitta olla ganccera kom7or yuuyeeza. Yeyigarkk yhann alamat unttis beeziza aqo maaqqekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:21">2 Zeena. 24:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>Yhayititay ubbitay u ammanay bagga markatikokka unttis inggintteez ufayssa haga denggeekaya. <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>Nu bayithii u folo maaqqaamay garkk Xoossay nuus ubbapp aadho baz bi7ii gaddeeza.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Xooss nu ade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Yikkee yhayitita aaziz markkitay shaara garkk nu lanqqayir yeziko nuukka toofo ubba ellis nuna mariza nagara nuupp haasii, nu ammanayis ommannee folo maaqqiz Yesuusana bi7ii nu tiinayid yez wotha danda7ar wolla woxxoda. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>Ezii iita baz ubba leqqii fa tiinayid yez ufayssayis maziqalel garzhii Xooss zufaane ushachcha betteeza. <verse eid="HEB 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>Yikkee yi azaalekkazarannee daaburekkazar nagaranchitaypp eza helleez ixo ubba garzheez Yesuusana bo7oytta. <verse eid="HEB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>Yi nagarara butinttittar haga suuthii laalinttod gatho ixxekaya. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/>Xoossii fa na7a garkk yinttan, yeegii zoreezana yi dogeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:17">Iyo. 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:11-12">Aazi. 3:11-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">«Ta na7ayyo goday seera leqqippe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">e nena kacciz wode daaburippe,<verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>Goday fa qadhdhiza na7a kacciza»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">Fa na7a harks audio bi7izan seeriza.<verse eid="HEB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>Xoossii fa na7a gi yinttan seeriza gishos danda7oytta. Ade seeroowa na7a oonoo? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>Na7a maaqqeez ubbitay ekkiza seera yinttikka ekkaam ixxikko ade erinttoowa na7itapp attin na7ita baaya. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>Yeyppekka aath nuna seeriza asho aditayis nuukka yashittiza, yeezin shemppor yezodayis ayyana ade maaqqeezayis azazinttodayis wayizii beezoosa? <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>Unttii paas lo77eezay garkk xiqqa wodes nuna seereeza, Eza maaqqiko nuna e xillotitha gishinttod garkk nuna adodayis seeriza. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Seera ubbay ye saatayid azanthiza bazapp attin ufayssiza aazooya, guyepp erii wurko sarotithi kumeez xillotithi aafe beeziza.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zorennee naagiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>Yey gishoss doli7eez kushittannee liqeez yi bunqqita minthoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:3">Isa. 35:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/>Shoolizay paxod garkkepp attin burqqamay garkk yi tokayis luule oge oothoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:26">Aazi. 4:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>Geeshshetithi bayithii asii Xoossa be7adayis danda7oowa gishos as ubbar saro yezoytta, geeshshettithar yezodayis miinggoytta. <verse eid="HEB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/>Yinttipp oosikka Xooss aadho keehetithi pacaamay garkk naaginttoytta yey garkkekka aba camo aafe aafiz xapho yi gancce dolaamay garkkennee yinttipp gaamita waayithaamay garkk, tunisaamay garkk yi gancce yezaamay garkk naaginttoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:18">Nam7i. 29:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/>Tenttotizannee Pettii toke muusis gi fa bayiratith bayizeez Eesawe garkk maaqqaamay garkk naaginttoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Medhe. 25:29-34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/>Eesawe guyepp anjjo ekkodayis koyinkka anjjo kayintteezana yi eriza, yeekkii afuxxi miinggii koyinkka demmadayis danda7ekkaya, maarotithisikka wode denggekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:30-40">Medhe. 27:30-40</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>Kusher ayikinttodayis danda7inttiza eexiz tamayiko, shaarayiko, dhumayiko, gotayiko, naasayiko, qaala bazayikokka yi hellekkaya. <verse eid="HEB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/>Ye tulitula giirthaykko woy odinttiza qaala si7inttizaykko yi hellekkaya, ya qaala si7eez asay hara qaala nuuss gujjinttippe gi woosseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:11-12">Kes. 4:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 19:16-22">19:16-22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">20:18-21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/>«Hara attozin do7a ye ambato bochchiko shuchchar shoccinttii yhayqqo» yeegiz azazay deexeez gishshos garzhodayiss danda7ekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:12-13">Kes. 19:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/>Musekka «Ta yashittiza ta kukkuriza» god gatho benttiz baz ubbay gaame yashshiz bazi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">Nam7i. 9:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Yinttan maaqqiko Xiyone ambako ukkeeza, izakka de7o Xoossayis katama salo yez yerusalaamato, yinttii payidoba kiitanchitayiko ukkeeza. <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/>U Sunthay salo xaafintteez, woosa keethis bayira na7a maaqqeez ammaniza asay shiiqo, ubbayis pirddiz god maaqqeezayiko, folo denggeez geeshsha shemppitayiko yi ukkeeza. <verse eid="HEB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/>Orothi caaqos giddo maaqqeez Yesuusako, Aabeela suuthaypp aadhii odiz wurxxintteez suuthayiko yi ukkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:10">Medhe. 4:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>Ye odizana yi ekkaamii gaamay garkk naaginttoytta, yeyititay sa7a asii odeez baz si7ekka attii buuttekkazin nuunii salopp odintteez baz ekkaam ixxii wayizii buuttode?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:22">Kes. 20:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/>Ye wode e giirthay biitta eni7iseeza, yhatti maaqqiko «Ta sa7a aadda baazin pettii toke mahii salokka eni7isoda» yeegii qaala geleeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag. 2:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>Hano zin pettii toke ta mahii gizay eni7oowa bazitay xaphphii yezoday garkk eni7iza bazitay medhintteez baz maaqqeezayis dhabodana beeziza. <verse eid="HEB 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Yikkee nuunii eni7oowa kaatetith ekkod gishos Xoossa bonchchittarannee yashshar Xoossa ufayssittar goynniza ayyana wolla ayikkoda. <verse eid="HEB 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/>Nu Xoossay xuugiz tama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Nam7i. 4:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Xooss ufayssiza goynno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>Ubba wode ishetith siiqo yinttis yesse. <verse eid="HEB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/>Imathi moko dogippate pettii pettii asay imathi mokkittar erekkazar pettii gallas kiitanchcho mokkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:1-8">Medhe. 18:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:1-3">19:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>Unttar wolla accintteez as garkk accintteez asa dogippate, meto unttar wolla ekkiza as maaqqii metintteez asa qoppoytta. <verse eid="HEB 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>Gelonnee eko ubba as kale bonchintteeza hiixayikka geesh maaqqo, nagaras tenttotizita laammizita Xoossay pirddoda, machchinnee azinii ammaninttaam ixxii gelonnee eko tunsippe.<verse eid="HEB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>Miishe yaarepp haakkoytta, yinttis yezana gido, Xooss «ta ubbar nena ashshaamii ubbarakka olaamii» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Nam7i. 31:6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Iyya. 1:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/>Yey gishos ezal ammaninttii «Goday tana maaddoda ta yashshittaamii; asii tana ab udodee?» nu yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Maz. 118:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>Yinttis tiina Xoossa qaala odeezi waanta asita qopoytta, u yessannee u oosay aafa bi7ii qoppii ammanor aazoytta.<verse eid="HEB 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/>Yesuus kiristtoosa ziqinnenee yhayino medhina hellodayiskka e eza. <verse eid="HEB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>Duma duma oroth timirtter ekinttipate, yi wozinay muus wogar baazin Xooss aadho keehatithar xaphiko lo77o, muus woga kaaleez asay maadinttekkaya.<verse eid="HEB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Nuus yarsho aqo yeza, maaqqikkokka dunkkaane gancce oothiza qeesitay yarshsho aqo katha ekii maadayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="HEB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/>Ayihude qeesitay halaqay nagara baaranchodayis mehe suuth ekkii Xooss kara qola7a geliza, ashana heerapp gaxa kessii xuugiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:27">Lewii. 16:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Yesuusa yey garkk fa gazza suuthayir asa geeshshodayis katamaypp gaxa kezii meto ekkeeza. <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Nuukka heerapp kezii wolla eeko yhammada, e kawushshatithakka wolla shaginttoda. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Nuun haga ye7odayis yez katamtto naginepp attin miinggii yeziz katama yha sa7all nuus baaya.<verse eid="HEB 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>Yikkee Yesuus kiristtoosa baggar galata yarshsho ubba wode Xoossis wolla shiishoda, yeykka e sunthayis markkatiz metershitaypp shiiqiza galata yarshsho. <verse eid="HEB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>Lo77o baz oothonnee yeza bazapp haras shago dogipate, Xooss ufayssizay yeyigarkk yarshsho.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>Yinttan aqisizitayis kiitinttoytta, u mawutayppekka oommor yezoytta, unttii oyicinttiz mawute yeza gisho yi shemppayis waayiza, yi unttis kiitinttiko u fa oosa ufayssar oothoda, yeypp attiko azanttar oothiza, yey yinttan maaddiza baz baaya.<verse eid="HEB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>Nuus woossoytta, ubba bazar nu lo77or yezoday garkk nuus lo77o kaha nuuss yezana nu ereeza. <verse eid="HEB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>Ubbarakka ta yinttiko ellisii maaqqaday garkk miinggii woossoytta.<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssith woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20"/>Medhina caaqo suuthar bayira duritayis henthanchii maaqqeez nu Goda Yesuusana yhayiqopp dentheez sarotith Goda <verse eid="HEB 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21"/>E shena polod garkk lo77o ooso ubbar yinttan dancisho, eza ufayssiza baz Yesuusi Kiristtoosa baggar nuul ootho, Yesuus kiristtoosas medhinapp medhina hellodayis boncho maaqqo amin7e.<verse eid="HEB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Ta ishuntho yhanna ta xaafeezanna haata kiita maaqqeez gishshos ta zore qaalato danda7ar naagod garkk miinthii ta yinttan woossiza. <verse eid="HEB 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>Nu isha Ximaatoosa achchapp bili7intteezana eroytta. E ellis yhana yi7iko ta ezar wolla yinttan be7adayis yhammada.<verse eid="HEB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>Yinttan aqisiza asayisinnee geesh as ubbayis sarotha shiishoytta, Xaalanepp yi7ii yhaydda yez ammaneez asay sarotho yinttis shiishiza.<verse eid="HEB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>Aadho keehetithii nuur ubbayir maaqqo amin7e.<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
